#
# Substance: post-route DRC count derived from openroad
# detailed_route's per-net congestion/violation log lines. This is
# the router's own in-loop DRC pass.
# Sign-off DRC runs SEPARATELY at Step 31: when the PDK ships a
# Calibre/Assura `.rule` deck (input/pdk/calibre/), the runner
# executes that foundry deck NATIVELY via the vibeic KLayout SVRF
# engine (_try_svrf_native_drc) — NO Calibre license/binary
# required; that IS the sign-off-grade verdict. A KLayout `.lydrc`
# or `magic` deck is only the fallback when no SVRF deck exists.
